ctor_Clamp","referenceId":"reference:37dc8a2e8ca9a00c"}," (though the target ship must have been drawn into the ship's square by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tractor Beam"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tractor_Beam","referenceId":"reference:627f44a03c76e65b"},"). A Plasma Punch functions otherwise exactly the same as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Plasma Torch"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Plasma_Torch","referenceId":"reference:b1b36d90ca1a552e"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
